{"seq":1,"slug":"kaplan-scaling-laws","title":"Kaplan 扩展律：规模即正义的年代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/scaling-laws-bitter-lesson/empirical-scaling-laws/kaplan-scaling-laws","wordCount":1895,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"kaplan-扩展律-规模即正义的年代\">Kaplan 扩展律：规模即正义的年代</h1><p>2020 年 1 月，OpenAI 发布《Scaling Laws for Neural Language Models》（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2001.08361\">arXiv:2001.08361</a>），把一个此前只散落在少数实验室内部的直觉，变成了一条可以拿计算器算出来的工程准则：语言模型的验证损失随参数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、数据量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 与训练计算量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的增长服从幂律，而且这条幂律跨越六个以上数量级依然稳定。同年 5 月，GPT-3 以一千七百五十亿参数登场（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.14165\">arXiv:2005.14165</a>），用 few-shot 能力为这条定律做了第一次大规模背书。「规模即正义」的时代由此开启——接下来的两年里，头部实验室的核心信念可以压缩成一句话：只要算力还在往上堆，能力就会沿着那条平滑的曲线继续往下走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇涉及三个贯穿全章的关键词。<strong>幂律</strong>（power law）：损失与规模变量之间形如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\propto N^{-\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的关系，特征是对数坐标下呈直线、跨越数量级保持稳定。<strong>外推</strong>（extrapolation）：用小规模实验拟合指数、预测大规模模型表现的推理方法，是扩展律从科学观察变成工程工具的关键一步。<strong>预算分配</strong>（budget allocation）：给定总算力时在参数量与数据量之间的切分比例，Kaplan 给出的答案是七三开——这个数字后来被证明是整篇论文最脆弱的部分，但其「最优分配存在且可计算」的思想存活至今。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条独立的幂律\">三条独立的幂律</h2><p>论文最核心的贡献是把损失拆成了三个近乎独立的方向。固定其他变量后，损失分别近似满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>0.076</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>D</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>0.095</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>C</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>0.050</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(N) \\approx \\left(\\frac{N_c}{N}\\right)^{0.076}, \\qquad L(D) \\approx \\left(\\frac{D_c}{D}\\right)^{0.095}, \\qquad L(C) \\approx \\left(\\frac{C_c}{C}\\right)^{0.050}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.076</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.095</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.050</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个指数都很小，这正是幂律的可怕之处：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 每增大十倍，损失的相对降幅几乎恒定，不存在明显的边际收益悬崖，也不存在某个神秘的临界尺寸让曲线突然掉头。作者据此给出了联合形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(N,D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的参数化拟合并强调，只要同时扩大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，损失就由这两个方向的幂律叠加决定。对从业者而言，这意味着性能第一次变得<strong>可预算</strong>——你不需要训练完才知道结果，你可以在训练前就把最终损失估计到小数点后两位以内。</p>\n<p>另一组同样重要的结论关于预算分配。给定总计算预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\approx 6ND</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>（前向两次、反向四次的系数近似），论文建议按</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>0.73</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>D</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>0.27</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\propto C^{0.73}, \\qquad D \\propto C^{0.27}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.73</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.27</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分配参数与数据：算力每翻一倍，模型应该显著变大，而数据只需温和增加。这个不对称分配后来被证明是整篇论文中最经不起复检的部分，但它当时塑造的行为模式极其深远——2020 到 2022 年间几乎所有旗舰模型都朝着「更大参数、相对更少数据」的方向倾斜，直到被 Chinchilla 修正拉回，详见 <a href=\"chinchilla-revision\">Chinchilla 修正</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"六条经验法则\">六条经验法则</h2><p>除幂律本身外，论文还沉淀了一批可直接执行的经验法则，它们共同构成了那个年代的默认训练配方：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>经验法则</th>\n<th>论文结论</th>\n<th>对实践的直接影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构不敏感</td>\n<td>在合理范围内，Transformer 与稀疏化变体、LSTM 的差距只是常数因子</td>\n<td>选型焦虑被解除，资源全部押注 Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超参可迁移</td>\n<td>学习率、批大小、调度策略在小模型上调好后可直接外推到大模型</td>\n<td>大训练不再需要反复试错，网格实验留在小尺度完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大模型样本效率更高</td>\n<td>达到同样损失，大模型需要的 token 数远少于小模型</td>\n<td>「优先做大模型」有了定量依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算分配不对称</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 吃掉约七成算力增量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 只吃三成</td>\n<td>旗舰路线普遍参数先行，数据供给压力被低估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行度上限</td>\n<td>过大的批量会偏离临界批量，损失开始回升</td>\n<td>分布式训练的规模天花板被提前算出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>早停即可</td>\n<td>大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 配小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 会过拟合，但在幂律平台上早停就能规避</td>\n<td>数据稀缺问题被推迟而非解决</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些法则中影响最持久的不是某一条具体数字，而是它们合起来传递的世界观：训练大模型是一项可以被规划、被预算、被提前审计的工程，而不是一门手艺。今天回头看，这份「工程化自信」才是 Kaplan 扩展律真正的遗产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用小模型给大模型画图纸\">用小模型给大模型画图纸</h2><p>幂律最有价值的用法是<strong>外推</strong>。既然损失在小模型上严格服从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.076</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\propto N^{-0.076}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.076</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这类规律，那么用一批从几千万到十亿级的廉价实验拟合出指数，就能预测百亿、千亿级模型的最终表现。OpenAI 自己承认 GPT-3 的规模选择正是这套方法的产物；两年后的 GPT-4 技术报告（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.08774\">arXiv:2303.08774</a>）更是把这一方法展示到了极致——整个报告只用一条外推曲线预测了最终模型在某项内部基准上的表现，并声称实测值精准落在了预测线上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[小规模网格实验&lt;br/&gt;千万级到十亿级参数] --&gt; B[拟合幂律指数&lt;br/&gt;L 正比于 N 的负幂与 D 的负幂]&#10;    B --&gt; C[确定超参迁移规则&lt;br/&gt;学习率与批大小的缩放]&#10;    C --&gt; D{给定目标算力预算}&#10;    D --&gt; E[外推最优参数量与数据量&lt;br/&gt;N 占七成 D 占三成]&#10;    E --&gt; F[一次性执行大训练]&#10;    F --&gt; G[实测损失对照预测线&lt;br/&gt;偏差回灌修正指数]\">flowchart TD\n    A[小规模网格实验&lt;br/&gt;千万级到十亿级参数] --&gt; B[拟合幂律指数&lt;br/&gt;L 正比于 N 的负幂与 D 的负幂]\n    B --&gt; C[确定超参迁移规则&lt;br/&gt;学习率与批大小的缩放]\n    C --&gt; D{给定目标算力预算}\n    D --&gt; E[外推最优参数量与数据量&lt;br/&gt;N 占七成 D 占三成]\n    E --&gt; F[一次性执行大训练]\n    F --&gt; G[实测损失对照预测线&lt;br/&gt;偏差回灌修正指数]</pre><p>这条流水线值得逐段凝视，因为它定义了一种全新的研究形态：实验的主要产出不再是某个 checkpoint，而是<strong>对更大实验的预测能力</strong>。实验室之间的竞争也随之改写——谁的外推曲线更准，谁就敢在下一轮豪赌中下更大的注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平滑性埋下的两个伏笔\">平滑性埋下的两个伏笔</h2><p>「损失沿平滑幂律下降」这一图景，在两年内分别遭遇了来自内部和外部的修正。来自内部的是预算分配问题：Chinchilla 团队用四百多次受控训练发现，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>0.73</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{0.73}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.73</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分配系统性低估了数据的地位，「大模型配少数据」其实是在浪费算力，这场修正构成了下一章的主线，见 <a href=\"chinchilla-revision\">Chinchilla 修正</a>。来自外部的是度量层面的争议：如果底层损失平滑下降，为什么许多下游任务的能力看起来是在某个规模上「突然出现」的？涌现能力的争论本质上就是在追问平滑幂律与跳变式体验之间的关系，相关分析集中在 <a href=\"../limits-and-new-axes/emergence-controversy\">涌现能力之争</a>。</p>\n<p>还有一个更隐蔽的伏笔：幂律刻画的是预训练损失，而预训练损失并不直接等于用户关心的任何东西。当行业逐渐意识到推理成本、数据供给和部署经济性同样重要时，「把损失压到最低」这个单一目标函数就开始松动——这正是后 Chinchilla 时代一切分歧的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Kaplan 扩展律把大模型训练从手艺变成了可预算的工程，其遗产与局限同样清晰：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三条幂律跨越数量级稳定成立，「规模可预算」自此成为行业信念</li>\n<li>「参数吃七成算力」的分配方案定义了默认配方，也埋下被推翻的伏笔</li>\n<li>外推方法论——用小实验为大实验画图纸——是最持久的贡献</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Kaplan 扩展律：规模即正义的年代","id":"kaplan-扩展律-规模即正义的年代"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三条独立的幂律","id":"三条独立的幂律"},{"level":2,"text":"六条经验法则","id":"六条经验法则"},{"level":2,"text":"用小模型给大模型画图纸","id":"用小模型给大模型画图纸"},{"level":2,"text":"平滑性埋下的两个伏笔","id":"平滑性埋下的两个伏笔"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"Chinchilla 修正：计算最优训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/scaling-laws-bitter-lesson/empirical-scaling-laws/chinchilla-revision"}}